This component adapts usage patterns of The Planet Crafter's modding surface from the
Apache-2.0 projects listed below. No source file was copied. The patterns were re-implemented
after the upstream code was read. The exact files and lines are cited in the header of Plugin.cs
and in README.md.

  ThePlanetCrafterMods
    https://github.com/akarnokd/ThePlanetCrafterMods
    Copyright (c) 2022-2026, David Karnok & Contributors
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
    Read at commit e90edc20140278aee4a2ece2c62d9b630a2c9790. The removed CheatMinimap/Plugin_Capture.cs
    was read at 02eaf941b71b08564a7618a2dd82648100ce298c.
    Adapted: sector loading (/load-all-sectors and the photomapping coroutine), enumeration of
    WorldObjectFromScene (/list-golden-containers), the current-planet lookup, the procedural-instance
    check, the InputAction hotkey pattern, the HUD text message, and the csproj/reference layout
    (solution_private.targets).

  PlanetCrafterMods (Nicki0)
    https://github.com/mcnicki2002/PlanetCrafterMods
    Copyright 2025-2026 Nicolas Schaefer & Contributors
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
    Read at commit 95291376e1fcd8bd4e003122f5cb4352d4c9b3fe.
    Adapted: reading the randomizeMineables game setting, and BepInEx Paths.ConfigPath.

Also consulted, for the build layout only (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Chad Ohman):

  PlanetNavigator
    https://github.com/ChadOhman/PlanetNavigator (commit 5aa2d0a079df839a975f3676ba9d36471aba045b)
    Consulted: mod/PlanetNavigator/PlanetNavigator.csproj (BepInEx.Core 5.4.21, with UnityEngine and
    Netcode referenced from the game's Managed folder) and the "" to "Prime" planet-id mapping.

Build-time dependency, not redistributed by this repository:
  BepInEx (https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx), LGPL-2.1.

